            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ruoc",
            "review_text": "LamN\nSingapore, Singapore4905 contributions\n0\nDefinitely, the best Huế restaurant in Sài Gòn\nApr 2019 • Friends\nHuế cuisine is quite peculiar, and because of its strong flavours, may not be to most westerners’ liking. However, this restaurant, located not far from TSN airport and belonging to a famous writer-cum-painter from Huế (Mr. Mường Mán), serves the most authentic and delicious Huế food. If intimidated by the long menu, give your preferences to the lady owner (Mr. Mường Mán’s wife), and ask her to do the choosing for you. Prices are much more reasonable than at the ‘chic’ and less-good restaurants in centre-town (like Đông Phố or Tib).\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2019",
